# Many shared hosts return HTTP 500 if ANY .htaccess rule is not allowed.
# This file is COMMENTS ONLY — it cannot break your site.
#
# If index.html opens before index.php: delete the host's welcome index.html
# or use cPanel → Indexes / Default Document → put index.php first.
#
# Optional (only if your host allows it — if site breaks, delete this file):
# DirectoryIndex index.php index.html
